/-- **The theorem of the certificate.** For 9 points of the unit sphere of `ℝ⁴` with classes, in the domain
that the source declares (the inner product of every pair lies in the interval of its pair type, and the
inner products of every triple satisfy the inequalities of `dom.cuts` for its triple type), the energy
`∑ i < j, 1 / ‖x i - x j‖ ^ 2` exceeds `35 / 2`. -/
theorem energy {cls : Fin 9 → ℕ} {x : Fin 9 → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 4)}
    (hS : CAP.Wsos.InSource params.q cert dom cls x) :
    (35 : ℝ) / 2 < ∑ i, ∑ j ∈ Finset.univ.filter (fun j => i < j), 1 / ‖x i - x j‖ ^ 2 :=
  CAP.Wsos.energy_gt_fin holds dom_ok minorant bound_ok hS

/-- **The theorem of the claim `L3-k2: selected edge Q2-in`.** For 9 points of the unit sphere of `ℝ⁴` with classes such
that the inner product of every pair of distinct points lies in the interval of its pair type in the claim,
the energy exceeds `35 / 2`. -/
theorem energy_claim0 {cls : Fin 9 → ℕ} {x : Fin 9 → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 4)}
    (hC : CAP.Wsos.InClaim params.q cert claim0.K cls x) :
    (35 : ℝ) / 2 < ∑ i, ∑ j ∈ Finset.univ.filter (fun j => i < j), 1 / ‖x i - x j‖ ^ 2 :=
  energy (CAP.Wsos.inSource_of_claim claim0_ok hC)

